      "html": "<p>This pencil catfish is a relative of the parasitic catfishes and is very rarely traded. Its affiliation to the genus Pareiodon is fairly clear, but the species identification has not yet been clarified.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "beforeYouBuy",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/10-catfishes/10c-catfishes-remaining-catfish-from-south-america/pareiodon_cf_microps_en/",
      "html": "<p>As predators, they should not be kept with small fishes. Due to their rarity, no reports about their maintenance in the aquarium are available. For collectors of rarities: there is one albino.</p>"
    },
